\subsection{Conical Horizon and the Quadrupole--Octupole Alignment: Exact Harmonic Expansion}
\label{subsec:cone_axis_evil}
\label{subsec:cone_axis_evil_exact}

We derive the large-angle CMB signature of the conical horizon from first
principles. The total deficit $\delta_{\rm total}=\pi$ is partitioned equally
among three generator defects, each with deficit angle $\delta_j = \pi/3$. In
