This potential has a unique minimum at $\Xi = 2$ and $V_{\min}=0$.

\subsection{The TRSD Axiom}
\label{subsec:axiom_final}

The effective action for the defect condensate coupled to gravity is therefore
\begin{equation}
\boxed{
\delta\!\int d^4x\sqrt{-g}\left\{
\frac{c^4}{16\pi G}R
-\frac{\delta c^4}{16\pi G}g^{\mu\nu}\partial_\mu\phi_+\partial_\nu\phi_-
+ V(\Xi)
