\eqref{eq:mu_tor} with fixed $n=\pi/3$ and $a_0$ fixed at the TRSD value.
The only per-galaxy free parameter is $\Upsilon$, fitted by minimizing
the reduced $\chi^2$ against the observed velocity curve.

